  New ideas for easy use of pole arms without getting hit back:

  Break a wand of digging.  Instant pit/hole fort.  Better than
boulder fort because pole arms work across pits/holes.

  Get in the middle of a 3x3 square of Elbereths with objects on 
them.  Pound away with your polearm on hostile monsters.  The
more skilled you are, the better.  Even unskilled/restricted 
polearm can hit four squares.  

  Or get in a corner with Elbereth/object on the three 
surrounding squares.  Much quicker in an emergency.

  NB: Dust Elbereths with an object on them can still be messed 
up by pets and peacefuls.  Even permanent Elbereths can be messed
up by pets/peacefuls picking up the object(s) on them.

